{"id":136533956395153,"name":"Car Flipper [MYTHICAL]","desc":"Ever wondered if you have what it takes to turn rusty wrecks into legendary cars, build a car empire from scratch and drive your dream vehicle?\n\nWelcome to CAR FLIPPER!\nStart with a broken-down vehicle and turn it into something incredible. Buy damaged cars, repair them and customize them. Will you keep them in your collection or sell them for a profit? The choice is yours!\n\nWith 100+ unique vehicles and hundreds of customization options, every car can become a bestseller. Upgrade them, install performance parts and create cars that match your style.\n\nWhat awaits you?\n🔧 Restore and Repair \n🚘 Collect and Customize\n⚙️ Upgrade Performance\n🎨 Personalize Your Cars\n 🏙 Explore a Massive World\n🏢 Expand Your Workshop\n🏁 Race Your Friends\n\nWill you become a master mechanic, a successful car dealer or the owner of the ultimate car collection?\n\nStart your journey today and discover what awaits beyond the garage doors!","path":"/game/136533956395153-car-flipper","slug":"136533956395153-car-flipper","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/dc2424856543ddc2f66b99c53e144d676a25037169b720e6ab3e547255ae949c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-09024e7ab99f2049f72d660731b30d99/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2180,"visitor":60179552,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-10T10:11:16.579Z","creator":{"name":"A&B Group","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Car-Flipper-MYTHICAL-RC-ULTIMATE-AUTO-FARM-240714","_id":"6a4628550f56d137bffe158e","title":"RC ULTIMATE AUTO FARM","game":{"_id":"6a302420cf7067847233ed20","gameId":136533956395153,"name":"Car Flipper [MYTHICAL]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":136533956395153},"features":"MAIN FEATURES:\n\nPOWER & BRAKE SYSTEM\n\n• SPEED Multiplier (1x to 100x) – adjustable from the menu.\n\n• BRAKING Force (1% to 50%) – adjustable from the menu.\n\n• Full control with the W (accelerate) and S (brake) keys or with the touch buttons.\n\nCOMPLETE AUTO FARM\n\n• AUTO-BUY: Automatically buys cars based on the selected rarity.\n\n• FULL FARM: Buys → repairs → sells cars in an automatic cycle.\n\n• RARITY Filters: Choose which rarities you want to farm (Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Legendary).\n\n• AREA ROTATION: Teleports between zones to find more cars.\n\nAUTO-COLLECT\n\n• Automatically collects money and parts from your base.\n\n• Configurable 5-minute interval.\n\n• Manual button for instant collection.\n\nAUTO-DELIVERY\n\n• Automatically picks up and delivers items.\n\n• No teleportation bugs: simply dismounts, picks up, and remounts.\n\n• 30-second cooldown between deliveries.\n\nCOMPATIBILITY\n\n• Works on MOBILE and PC.\n\n• Interface adapts to any screen size.\n\n• Touch controls with haptic feedback\n\nTip: Make the script buy a lot of cars, the price doesn't matter as long as you buy a lot, and you can repair and sell them, that way you earn a lot more xd my tip","tags":["Multiplier","braking","auto farm","auto","farm"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastebin.com/raw/mHfa20Wd\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6995210ae729cc1c989d58f6","username":"_RC_","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c46a1628f2c5ccd3c5a240521ddb54963cd30e3ef84831d4380a0cfae01644f6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6995210ae729cc1c989d58f6-1782855786666.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6995210ae729cc1c989d58f6","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c46a1628f2c5ccd3c5a240521ddb54963cd30e3ef84831d4380a0cfae01644f6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6995210ae729cc1c989d58f6-1782855786666.png"}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"https://linkvertise.com/4933224/9QfxvVYHA1CO?o=sharing","views":5230,"script